translate brazil moonlollipopplay_aa90df5f:

#   m "Do you intend to observe like last time, Commander?"
    m "Pretende observar como da última vez, Comandante?"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1303
translate brazil moonlollipopplay_3f9810e3:

#   m "Or do you plan to explore for yourself the mysteries of this Moon?"
    m "Ou você planeja explorar por si mesmo os mistérios desta Lua?"

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:1306
translate brazil moonlollipopplay_9010e578:

#   mc "\"Houston\", \"Voyager I\" is at full liftoff, ready to explore that celestial body."
