translate brazil gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_95fb2614:

#   emi "Was I justified, or was I too much? Was it worth losing her for the sake of my pride?"
    emi "Eu estava justificado, ou exagerei? Valia a pena perdê-la por causa do meu orgulho?"

