translate brazil gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_2f80f75c:

#   g "Yeah, since we're graduating in a couple of weeks, this..."
    g "Sim, já que nos formamos daqui a algumas semanas, isso..."

# game/ch1ep2.rpy:5737
translate brazil gwenfamilyreconcilecontinue_872e9d40:

#   g "... Is going to be my last memory of you."
    g "...Essa será minha última lembrança de você."

